    "id": "train-882",
    "question": "An unusual bicycle has 20 spokes on the front wheel and twice as many spokes on the back wheel. How many spokes does the bicycle have?",
    "gold": "60",
    "answer": "The back wheel has double the spokes the front wheel has, which means the back wheel has 20*2=<<20*2=40>>40 spokes.\nIn total, the bicycle has 20+40=<<20+40=60>>60 spokes.\n#### 60"
  },
  "generation": {
    "text": "To determine the total number of spokes on the bicycle, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Identify the number of spokes on the front wheel.\n2. Calculate the number of spokes on the back wheel.\n3. Add the number of spokes on the front wheel and the back wheel to get the total number of spokes.\n\nStep 1: Identify the number of spokes on the front wheel.\nThe front wheel has 20 spokes.\n\nStep 2: Calculate the number of spokes on the back wheel.\nThe back wheel has twice as many spokes as the front wheel. Therefore, the number of spokes on the back wheel is:\n\\[ 2 \\times 20 = 40 \\]\n\nStep 3: Add the number of spokes on the front wheel and the back wheel to get the total number of spokes.\nThe total number of spokes is:\n\\[ 20 + 40 = 60 \\]\n\nThus, the total number of spokes on the bicycle is \\(\\boxed{60}\\).",
